// Spoilage rows (items spec 3.5): ppm of the quantity lost per game day, by the kind of store. A store kind without its own value uses house_ppm.
// Grain 3,414 ppm/day = 5% a season in a house or barn, 670 = 1% in a granary (plan 3a). Fresh fish rots about 3 days.
[
  { "type": "spoil_class", "id": "grain",       "house_ppm": 3414, "granary_ppm": 670, "sealed_ppm": 670, "cellar_ppm": 670 },
